    <briefdescription>
<para>RAII wrapper for database connections. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Manages the lifecycle of a database connection handle. Automatically closes the connection on destruction.</para>
<para>Exception-safe: destructor is noexcept.</para>
<para>Generic implementation - can be specialized for specific database types. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
